exports[`gunlukakis ziyaretçi HTML > düzenleme katmanından önceki hâliyle aynı 1`] = `"<div class="min-h-screen bg-paper"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Ana Sayfa","item":"https://sekeranaokulu.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Günlük Akış","item":"https://sekeranaokulu.com/gunluk-akis"}]}</script><main><section class="band-sunny relative overflow-hidden pb-16 pt-14 md:pb-20 md:pt-20"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><span class="confetti-float absolute left-[6%] top-8 h-16 w-16 rounded-full bg-sunny/25"></span><span class="confetti-float absolute right-[8%] top-6 h-24 w-24 rounded-full bg-bubble/20"></span><span class="confetti-float absolute right-[22%] bottom-12 h-10 w-10 rotate-12 rounded-xl bg-mint/25"></span><span class="confetti-float absolute left-[18%] bottom-10 h-8 w-8 rotate-45 rounded-md bg-sky/25"></span><span class="confetti-float absolute left-[46%] top-4 h-6 w-6 rounded-full bg-white/20"></span></div><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 text-center"><p class="timecode text-white/70">Karşılamadan çıkışa</p><h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl text-white md:text-5xl">Bir günümüz</h1><p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base text-white/85 md:text-lg">Velilerin bize en çok sorduğu soru: "Çocuğum orada bütün gün ne yapıyor?" Cevabı aşağıda, sahne sahne.</p></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 scallop"></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-12"><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-3xl bg-paper-warm p-6"><p class="timecode text-grape">Tam gün</p><p class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl text-ink">07:30–18:30</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">Aşağıdaki akışın tamamı bu programda yaşanıyor.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl bg-paper-warm p-6"><p class="timecode text-bubble-deep">Yarım gün</p><p class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl text-ink">07:30–13:00</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">Sabah çemberi, Montessori çalışması, İngilizce ve bahçe zamanını kapsıyor.</p></div></div></section><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-6 pt-14 lg:grid-cols-[180px_1fr]"><nav aria-label="Günün bölümleri" class="sticky top-28 hidden h-fit rounded-3xl bg-paper-warm p-5 lg:block"><ol class="space-y-1"><li class="cine-spine-item" data-active="true"><a href="#karsilama" aria-current="location" class="group block rounded-xl px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:bg-white bg-white"><span class="timecode text-grape block">Sahne 01</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink group-hover:text-grape">Karşılama</span></a></li><li class="cine-spine-item" data-active="false"><a href="#sabah-cemberi" class="group block rounded-xl px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:bg-white "><span class="timecode text-grape block">Sahne 02</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink group-hover:text-grape">Sabah çemberi</span></a></li><li class="cine-spine-item" data-active="false"><a href="#calisma-saati" class="group block rounded-xl px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:bg-white "><span class="timecode text-grape block">Sahne 03</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink group-hover:text-grape">Montessori çalışma saati</span></a></li><li class="cine-spine-item" data-active="false"><a href="#ingilizce" class="group block rounded-xl px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:bg-white "><span class="timecode text-grape block">Sahne 04</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink group-hover:text-grape">İngilizce</span></a></li><li class="cine-spine-item" data-active="false"><a href="#bahce" class="group block rounded-xl px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:bg-white "><span class="timecode text-grape block">Sahne 05</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink group-hover:text-grape">Bahçe</span></a></li><li class="cine-spine-item" data-active="false"><a href="#ogle" class="group block rounded-xl px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:bg-white "><span class="timecode text-grape block">Sahne 06</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink group-hover:text-grape">Öğle</span></a></li><li class="cine-spine-item" data-active="false"><a href="#dinlenme" class="group block rounded-xl px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:bg-white "><span class="timecode text-grape block">Sahne 07</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink group-hover:text-grape">Dinlenme</span></a></li><li class="cine-spine-item" data-active="false"><a href="#atolye" class="group block rounded-xl px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:bg-white "><span class="timecode text-grape block">Sahne 08</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink group-hover:text-grape">Branş dersleri</span></a></li><li class="cine-spine-item" data-active="false"><a href="#cikis" class="group block rounded-xl px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:bg-white "><span class="timecode text-grape block">Sahne 09</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink group-hover:text-grape">Çıkış</span></a></li><li class="cine-spine-item" data-active="false"><a href="#kapanis" class="group block rounded-xl px-3 py-2 transition-colors hover:bg-white "><span class="timecode text-grape block">Sahne 10</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink group-hover:text-grape">Kapanış</span></a></li></ol></nav><div class="space-y-8"><section id="karsilama" class="cine-chapter scroll-mt-32 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-rule md:p-10"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mb-4 block h-1.5 w-14 rounded-full bg-sunny"></span><span class="timecode text-grape ">Sahne 01</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl text-ink md:text-4xl">Karşılama</h2><p class="mt-3 text-lg text-ink-soft">Gün, her çocuğun kendi temposunda başlar.</p><div class="mt-8"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-paper-warm ring-1 ring-rule aspect-[4/5] md:aspect-[2.39/1]" style="view-transition-name: day-karsilama;"><img alt="Çam ağaçlarının altındaki zürafa heykelleri ve bahçede oynayan çocuklar" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position: absolute; height: 100%; width: 100%; left: 0px; top: 0px; right: 0px; bottom: 0px; color: transparent;" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1100px" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2Fzurafalar-bahce.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fzurafalar-bahce.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fzurafalar-bahce.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fzurafalar-bahce.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fzurafalar-bahce.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fzurafalar-bahce.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fzurafalar-bahce.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fzurafalar-bahce.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fzurafalar-bahce.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 mix-blend-multiply" style="background-color: var(--color-dawn); opacity: 0.22;"></div></div></div><div class="mt-8 max-w-2xl"><p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">Kapı sabah erken açılır. İlk gelen çocuk günün en sessiz saatini yakalar; ayrılık bu saatte en kolay geçer.</p><p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">Sonrasında geçen süre serbesttir. Kimse oyuna zorlanmaz, kimse acele ettirilmez.</p></div></section><section id="sabah-cemberi" class="cine-chapter scroll-mt-32 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-rule md:p-10"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mb-4 block h-1.5 w-14 rounded-full bg-mint"></span><span class="timecode text-grape ">Sahne 02</span><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl text-ink md:text-4xl">Sabah çemberi</h2><p class="mt-3 text-lg text-ink-soft">Sınıf bir araya gelir, gün birlikte planlanır.</p><div class="mt-8"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-paper-warm ring-1 ring-rule aspect-[4/5] md:aspect-[2.39/1]" style="view-transition-name: day-sabah-cemberi;"><img alt="Açık hava sınıfında oltayla balık tutma oyunu oynayan çocuk, arkada tamir köşesi" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position: absolute; height: 100%; width: 100%; left: 0px; top: 0px; right: 0px; bottom: 0px; color: transparent;" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1100px" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2Facik-hava-sinifi.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Facik-hava-sinifi.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Facik-hava-sinifi.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Facik-hava-sinifi.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Facik-hava-sinifi.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Facik-hava-sinifi.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Facik-hava-sinifi.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Facik-hava-sinifi.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Facik-hava-sinifi.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 mix-blend-multiply" style="background-color: var(--color-morning); opacity: 0.16;"></div></div></div><div class="mt-8 max-w-2xl"><p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">Kim ne çalışacak, hangi branş dersi var, bahçeye ne zaman çıkılacak — hepsi bu çemberde konuşulur.</p><p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">Sınıf mevcudumuz sınırlı ve her sınıfta iki öğretmen birden görev yapıyor. Bu yüzden çemberde söz sırası herkese geliyor; hiçbir çocuk konuşmadan güne başlamıyor.</p></div><div class="mt-10 max-w-md"><figure class="m-0"><svg viewBox="0 0 205 162" class="w-full max-w-sm" aria-hidden="true"><circle data-mark="child" class="roster-mark" style="animation-delay: 0ms;" cx="14" cy="14.5" r="8.2" fill="var(--color-mark)"></circle><circle data-mark="child" class="roster-mark" style="animation-delay: 45ms;" cx="41.1" cy="12.7" r="8.584999999999999" fill="var(--color-mark)"></circle><circle data-mark="child" class="roster-mark" style="animation-delay: 90ms;" cx="65.2" cy="14.9" r="7.919999999999999" fill="var(--color-mark)"></circle><cir